{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1784763887_92664_77faf796d714aadbe3435190a94aa5d9.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(76,38,2);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(240,238,233);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Craft'n Build is a digital studio built around one belief: that professional design methodology should be accessible to anyone serious enough to use it.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(76,38,2);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(240,238,233);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">We build courses, templates, tools, and resources that reflect the way professionals actually work — not simplified versions of it, not watered-down introductions. The real frameworks, the real process, the real thinking behind great design.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(76,38,2);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(240,238,233);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Craft'n Build is for designers who are serious about their craft — whatever their background, whatever their title. For the professional who wants to sharpen their process. For the student who wants to learn how it really works. For the homeowner who refuses to settle for less than intentional design.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(76,38,2);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(240,238,233);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Design is not a credential. It is a discipline. And that is exactly how we treat it.</p></div></div>",
